1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:03,720
It's after 9:00.
At this hour, the streets of Pasadena...

2
00:00:03,886 --> 00:00:06,976
(Sheldon:)...are teeming with
drunken sailors and alley cats.

3
00:00:08,432 --> 00:00:10,102
Do you wanna talk about it?

4
00:00:10,267 --> 00:00:15,107
(Sheldon:)No, I think I'll just go in this
saloon and drink my troubles away.

5
00:00:20,319 --> 00:00:23,859
(Leonard:)You know digital alcohol
is never a solution.

6
00:00:25,449 --> 00:00:27,369
(Leonard:)What's going on?

7
00:00:28,285 --> 00:00:30,285
(Sheldon:)Hard as this may be to believe...

8
00:00:30,454 --> 00:00:34,544
(Sheldon:)...it's possible that I'm
not boyfriend material.

9
00:00:37,878 --> 00:00:40,338
(Leonard:)Glad I was sitting down for that.

10
00:00:41,673 --> 00:00:43,593
(Leonard:)Did you and Amy get in a fight?

11
00:00:43,759 --> 00:00:46,469
(Sheldon:)Amy had a fight.
I was being perfectly reasonable.

12
00:00:47,679 --> 00:00:49,719
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna have a whiskey.
Want anything?

13
00:00:51,433 --> 00:01:00,023
(Leonard:)No, I can't.
I'm playing "Grand Theft Auto" later.

